@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #50C878
    BorderColor #2D8659
    FontColor #FFFFFF
    StartColor #4A90E2
    EndColor #9B59B6
}

[*] --> Idle: App Start
Idle --> SelectingLanguage: User Opens App
SelectingLanguage --> SelectingSkill: Language Selected
SelectingSkill --> LoadingLesson: Skill Selected
LoadingLesson --> LessonReady: Lesson Loaded
LessonReady --> ShowingExercise: Start Lesson
ShowingExercise --> WaitingAnswer: Exercise Displayed
WaitingAnswer --> ProcessingAnswer: User Answers
ProcessingAnswer --> AnswerCorrect: Validation Pass
ProcessingAnswer --> AnswerIncorrect: Validation Fail
AnswerCorrect --> UpdatingProgress: Update XP
AnswerIncorrect --> CheckingHearts: Check Hearts
CheckingHearts --> ShowingExercise: Hearts > 0
CheckingHearts --> LessonFailed: Hearts = 0
UpdatingProgress --> MovingNext: Progress Updated
MovingNext --> ShowingExercise: More Exercises
MovingNext --> LessonComplete: All Done
LessonComplete --> CalculatingResults: Compute Stats
CalculatingResults --> UpdatingDatabase: Save Progress
UpdatingDatabase --> ShowingCompletion: Show Results
LessonFailed --> Restarting: User Clicks Restart
Restarting --> LessonReady: Reset State
ShowingCompletion --> [*]: User Closes

note right of ShowingExercise
    Exercise Types:
    - Multiple Choice
    - Translation
    - Listening
    - Matching
    - Fill in Blank
end note

note right of UpdatingProgress
    Updates:
    - XP Points
    - Level
    - Streak
    - Skill Progress
end note

@enduml
